    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver\u2019s seat of this <i>fast</i>, <strong>chaotic</strong>, and skill-driven racing experience, where you play as Carl \u2014 a monkey mailman who\u2019s been late on his deliveries. Fed up with your missed deadlines, your boss has rigged your truck with explosives\u2026 and the timer\u2019s already ticking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/e4d33c69c352128f309e8abb35df16d5.webp?t=1753431201\" width=214 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple... deliver the mail before time runs out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/68189c85155fe1ed393bffa307733991.poster.avif?t=1753431201\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/68189c85155fe1ed393bffa307733991.webm?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/68189c85155fe1ed393bffa307733991.mp4?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/4b0461e6f110e36ff395fad5e1e7f075.webp?t=1753431201\" width=210 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 8 players \u2014 invite friends or match with other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/f31084b3ee3d71a259748be9ec843bf3.poster.avif?t=1753431201\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/f31084b3ee3d71a259748be9ec843bf3.webm?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/f31084b3ee3d71a259748be9ec843bf3.mp4?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/1304732314055aa6547b0041980cc254.webp?t=1753431201\" width=126 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pull off flips, dodge obstacles, and beat the clock \u2014 or explode trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/12783ea3ad32183013f914c8ea14d421.poster.avif?t=1753431201\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/12783ea3ad32183013f914c8ea14d421.webm?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/12783ea3ad32183013f914c8ea14d421.mp4?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/c64702aa0336d925e04a031ec19e62a2.avif?t=1753431201\" data-has-big width=800 height=169 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver\u2019s seat of this <i>fast</i>, <strong>chaotic</strong>, and skill-driven racing experience, where you play as Carl \u2014 a monkey mailman who\u2019s been late on his deliveries. Fed up with your missed deadlines, your boss has rigged your truck with explosives\u2026 and the timer\u2019s already ticking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/e4d33c69c352128f309e8abb35df16d5.webp?t=1753431201\" width=214 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple... deliver the mail before time runs out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/68189c85155fe1ed393bffa307733991.poster.avif?t=1753431201\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/68189c85155fe1ed393bffa307733991.webm?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/68189c85155fe1ed393bffa307733991.mp4?t=1753431201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/4b0461e6f110e36ff395fad5e1e7f075.webp?t=1753431201\" width=210 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 8 players \u2014 invite friends or match with other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_